---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../schema.ts';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy — Is it just a wrapper?"
  description="What this site collects, who it shares it with, and how to say no."
>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p class="lede">What this site collects, who sees it, and how to opt out. Short, because there is not much.</p>

  <div class="stack" style="margin-top:2rem">
    <section class="clause">
      <h2>Without your consent</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Traffic totals.</strong> The site is served through Cloudflare, which counts requests for every site it
        hosts. We publish its daily totals of page views and unique visitors on <a href="/stats/">stats</a>. No cookie
        or script of ours is involved, and nothing finer is collected or kept by us.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Sponsor clicks.</strong> Clicking a sponsor link increments a counter for that slot on our server. Only
        the count is stored.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Your settings.</strong> Your theme and your cookie choice are saved in your own browser's storage. They
        never reach us.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="clause">
      <h2>With your consent: X advertising</h2>
      <p>
        We advertise on X (formerly Twitter). If you click <em>Accept</em> on the cookie banner, the site loads X's
        website tag, which sets cookies and sends X the pages you visit here, your IP address and your browser details,
        so that X can tell us how many people arrived from our ads. X processes that data under
        <a href="https://x.com/en/privacy" rel="noopener">its own privacy policy</a>; we see only aggregate campaign
        figures in X's ads dashboard, never anything about you.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you click <em>Decline</em>, or ignore the banner, the tag never loads and nothing is sent to X. Change your
        mind at any time with <button type="button" class="linklike" id="consent-open-inline">cookie settings</button>,
        also in the footer of every page.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="clause">
      <h2>What we never do</h2>
      <p>
        No other analytics or advertising scripts, no fingerprinting, no selling or sharing of data with anyone besides
        the above. There are no accounts on this site, so there is no profile of you to keep.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="clause">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions or requests about your data: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. If you email us,
        we keep the correspondence only as long as it is needed to answer you.
      </p>
      <p class="small muted">Last updated 28 September 2026.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<script>
  document.getElementById('consent-open-inline')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    document.getElementById('consent-open')?.click();
  });
</script>
